   "prompt": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a warm late-afternoon medium-wide tracking shot follows a young adult Asian woman in elegant pale-blue ancient Chinese hanfu as she strolls at an unhurried pace along a lively stone-paved old street. Her long dark hair is half-up with a simple jade hairpin; her sleeves and skirt sway naturally. Traditional wooden shops with hanging cloth banners, bamboo baskets, lanterns, and open storefronts line both sides of the street. The camera tracks backward smoothly in front of her as merchants arrange goods and pedestrians pass behind her. [Shot 2] At 00:07.500, the camera cuts to a side tracking shot, maintaining her left-to-right walking direction. She pauses briefly beside a tea shop to glance at a row of steaming cups, then continues forward as two little girls in bright traditional clothes run from the far side of the street into the foreground, their laughter drawing her attention. [Shot 3] At 00:15.000, the camera cuts to a low, child-height tracking shot following the girls as they weave playfully between a fabric stall and a fruit vendor, still moving in the same direction along the street. Their small footsteps scatter a few fallen flower petals; the woman remains visible farther behind them, smiling gently as she resumes her leisurely walk. [Shot 4] At 00:22.000, the camera cuts to a wider elevated angle looking down the street. The girls complete their run by circling a wooden post and racing back toward the woman; she steps lightly aside to give them room, then looks up at the bustling lane. Vendors exchange goods, a shopkeeper lifts a lantern, and passersby fill the layered depth of the frame. [Shot 5] At 00:27.000, the camera slowly pulls out with small amplitude as the woman walks onward down the center of the street, the girls continuing to chase each other in the midground behind her. The warm sunlight catches the lanterns, tiled roofs, and drifting fabric banners, ending on a broad, vivid view of the active ancient marketplace.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft footfalls on stone pavement, lively market chatter, fabric banners fluttering, ceramic cups clinking, and distant vendor calls fill the street. The girls’ clear laughter and quick footsteps move through the scene, with occasional wooden cart wheels and birds chirping overhead.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Light bamboo flute melody at a moderate tempo, supported by soft pipa plucks and gentle hand percussion. The arrangement gradually opens into a fuller traditional instrumental phrase during the final wide view."
